===== STEP 3 SUMMARY: actionlint/python validator + command list =====

actionlint is not installed in this environment. The python fallback
scripts/validate-workflows.py is the agent-executable substitute and is
documented in the workflow acceptance criteria. The validator covers:
  1. Privileged jobs MUST target self-hosted runners via
     kernel-<ver>-arch-<arch>.
  2. Every privileged job MUST include a step gated on always()/failure()
     whose name OR run body emits a GitHub annotation AND signals blocked.
  3. The deterministic workflow MUST declare a top-level concurrency group.
  4. Deterministic and scheduled-aggregate jobs MUST run on hosted
     ubuntu-* labels only.

